nWe contributed visionOS support in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975.\r\n\r\nThis follow-up implements several additional visionOS 26 features through the Compositor Services API:\r\n- Progressive immersion style. This needed wrapping `cp_drawable_encode_present()` in an empty draw pass, in order to draw the immersive portal. There'd be a more efficient way of doing if we could intercept the last submitted command buffer of the engine, but it was left out of scope of this PR.\r\n- Dynamic immersion style switching. Needed changing Apple embedded platforms `UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes` `false` -> `true`.\r\n- Dynamic render quality, with corresponding `xr/visionos` project settings.\r\n- Dynamic upper hand and system overlays visibility toggling, with initial values from the new `xr/visionos` project settings.\r\n- Emit the Swift to ObjC interop header from the SCons Swift builder (to support dynamic C++ -> Swift property propagation).\r\n\r\ncc @BastiaanOlij @stuartcarnie ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9548448620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACOSHDbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:visionos","name":"platform:visionos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milesto